WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.147 --> 00:00:15.428
watched the strange girl skip down West Street.

2
00:00:16.368 --> 00:00:17.769
"La, la, la, la, la!"

3
00:00:18.069 --> 00:00:18.809
the girl sang.

4
00:00:18.829 --> 00:00:23.731
"That girl is shrinking things all over Metro City," thought Roxy.

5
00:00:24.791 --> 00:00:27.692
"I have to stop her before the entire city is gone!"

6
00:00:30.268 --> 00:00:32.570
As Roxy started to fly, she heard a sound.

7
00:00:33.771 --> 00:00:39.636
Meow! A cat was looking at something on the sidewalk.

8
00:00:40.557 --> 00:00:41.437
Roxy looked down.

9
00:00:41.457 --> 00:00:45.420
"Tiny people!"

10
00:00:45.781 --> 00:00:46.561
Roxy cried.

11
00:00:47.822 --> 00:00:50.364
Small, scared people were running away from the cat.

12
00:00:50.384 --> 00:00:52.546
"Please help!"

13
00:00:52.927 --> 00:00:53.747
someone cried.

14
00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:56.589
"That cat is going to eat us!"

15
00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.111
shouted another person.

16
00:00:59.372 --> 00:01:01.993
Meow! The cat leaped through the air.

17
00:01:03.475 --> 00:01:05.256
Roxy caught the cat before it landed.

18
00:01:05.276 --> 00:01:07.217
"Bad kitty!"

19
00:01:07.437 --> 00:01:07.938
she said.

20
00:01:07.958 --> 00:01:09.979
"You shouldn't eat people!"

21
00:01:15.103 --> 00:01:17.485
Roxy led the tiny people into a pizza shop.

22
00:01:21.988 --> 00:01:23.289
"Stay here," she said.

23
00:01:23.309 --> 00:01:27.192
"I'm going to stop this shrinking right now!"

24
00:01:29.032 --> 00:01:30.373
Roxy ran back outside.

25
00:01:30.393 --> 00:01:32.694
"Rocket Girl!"

26
00:01:32.934 --> 00:01:33.955
screamed a tiny voice.

27
00:01:33.975 --> 00:01:35.896
"Help me!"

28
00:01:35.916 --> 00:01:37.997
"Who needs help now?"

29
00:01:38.277 --> 00:01:39.038
Roxy wondered.

30
00:01:40.078 --> 00:01:42.220
She looked up and saw a hawk flying away.

31
00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:44.961
Roxy used her super vision.

32
00:01:46.502 --> 00:01:49.704
"Uh-oh!" Roxy cried.

33
00:01:49.724 --> 00:01:53.026
"That hawk is flying away with a tiny man!"

34
00:01:54.166 --> 00:01:55.427
Roxy shot through the air.

35
00:01:56.588 --> 00:02:00.665
Zoom! "Hand over that little man!"

36
00:02:00.885 --> 00:02:01.986
Roxy yelled at the hawk.

37
00:02:02.927 --> 00:02:04.788
The hawk dropped the man and flew away.

38
00:02:04.808 --> 00:02:06.569
"Oh no!"

39
00:02:06.729 --> 00:02:07.510
the man shouted.

40
00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:09.171
"I'm falling!"

41
00:02:10.311 --> 00:02:13.353
Zoom! Roxy flew fast and caught the man.

42
00:02:13.373 --> 00:02:18.237
"Whew!" said Roxy as she landed.

43
00:02:19.958 --> 00:02:22.259
Crunch! "What was that?"

44
00:02:22.600 --> 00:02:23.380
Roxy wondered.

45
00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:26.542
"Hey!" A tiny voice yelled.

46
00:02:26.562 --> 00:02:29.084
"I just bought that car!"

47
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:31.001
Roxy looked down.

48
00:02:32.722 --> 00:02:35.643
A small smashed car fell from the bottom of her boot.

49
00:02:37.925 --> 00:02:39.005
"Sorry about that!"

50
00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:40.026
Roxy said.

51
00:02:42.527 --> 00:02:44.708
Again Roxy leaped into the air and flew off.

52
00:02:44.728 --> 00:02:48.931
"Now I need to find that strange girl," said Roxy.

53
00:02:50.192 --> 00:02:51.712
Roxy flew above Metro City.

54
00:02:55.635 --> 00:02:57.756
She looked everywhere, but she didn't see the girl.

55
00:03:03.372 --> 00:03:06.413
"Hmph!" Roxy sat on the roof of a building to think.

56
00:03:07.594 --> 00:03:09.574
Suddenly Whirr!

57
00:03:10.175 --> 00:03:12.055
The building under her started shrinking!

58
00:03:12.976 --> 00:03:14.616
And the girl was down on the street!

59
00:03:15.877 --> 00:03:17.117
Roxy leaped off the building.

60
00:03:21.859 --> 00:03:23.320
a cute little building!"

61
00:03:24.460 --> 00:03:27.262
The girl giggled and put the building into one of her pockets.

62
00:03:27.282 --> 00:03:30.723
"La, la, la, la, la!"

63
00:03:31.283 --> 00:03:33.204
The girl sang as she skipped down the street.

64
00:03:34.508 --> 00:03:35.749
"Hey!" yelled Roxy.

65
00:03:35.769 --> 00:03:37.491
"Stop right there!"

66
00:03:39.934 --> 00:03:42.857
The strange girl looked up and saw Roxy zooming down at her.

67
00:03:44.198 --> 00:03:45.339
The girl looked scared.

68
00:03:45.359 --> 00:03:48.142
"Oh!" the girl cried.

69
00:03:48.162 --> 00:03:49.564
"Oh no!"

70
00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:52.647
The little girl pointed the device at Roxy.

71
00:03:53.648 --> 00:03:56.311
Whirr! "Ahh!"

72
00:03:56.531 --> 00:03:57.332
Roxy screamed.
